# game/chapters/chapter5/script/ch5sc14.rpy:1952
translate brazil ch5sc14_b4d5c264:

#   bn "Why, Taron? Why, after all these years? You were loyal to the crown for so long..."
    bn "Por quê, Taron? Por quê, depois de todos esses anos? Você foi leal à coroa por tanto tempo..."

# game/chapters/chapter5/script/ch5sc14.rpy:1954
translate brazil ch5sc14_5462c01a:

#   bn "Has he been deceiving me since our time together at the Knights academy? Surely not... we were just kids."
